{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: 推理与规划MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"记忆冲突解决与时间衰减\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"推理与规划\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> medium\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/推理规划\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92/%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92/%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">推理与规划MOC</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h1>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Agent 的记忆系统中，当新信息与已有记忆冲突时如何处理？如何设计时间衰减机制避免记忆膨胀？</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"1. 答案\" dir=\"auto\">1. 答案</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>记忆冲突的处理</strong>：</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">记忆冲突发生在当新获取的信息与已有记忆矛盾时，比如：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">用户之前说\"我喜欢React\"，现在说\"我改用Vue了\"</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">之前记录\"产品价格为100元\"，现在查到\"价格为120元\"</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>冲突处理原则</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>时间戳优先</strong>：新信息优先（带时间戳）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>用户确认权重高</strong>：用户明确修正的信息覆盖旧信息</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>保留历史版本</strong>：不删除旧记忆，标记为\"过期\"</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>一致性校验</strong>：定期检测冲突，提示人工确认</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">MemoryConflictResolver</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"记忆冲突解决器\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> llm\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">detect_conflict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> new_memory<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> MemoryEntry<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> \n                        existing_memories<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>MemoryEntry<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>MemoryEntry<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"检测与已有记忆的冲突\"\"\"</span>\n        conflicts <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> mem <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> existing_memories<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 语义相似度判断</span>\n            sim <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> cosine_similarity<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>new_memory<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>embedding<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> mem<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>embedding<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> sim <span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.85</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 相似度过高，可能是同一主题</span>\n                <span class=\"token comment\"># 进一步检查是否矛盾</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_is_contradictory<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>new_memory<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> mem<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                    conflicts<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>mem<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> conflicts\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_is_contradictory</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> text1<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> text2<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">bool</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"判断两段文本是否矛盾\"\"\"</span>\n        prompt <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"\"\"判断以下两段信息是否矛盾，只回答 Yes 或 No：\n信息1: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>text1<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n信息2: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>text2<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n是否矛盾？\"\"\"</span></span>\n        result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>generate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> max_tokens<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"yes\"</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> result<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>lower<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">resolve_conflict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> new_memory<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> MemoryEntry<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> \n                         conflicting<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>MemoryEntry<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> Resolution<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"解决冲突\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> old <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> conflicting<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> old<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>source <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"user_explicit\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token comment\"># 用户之前明确声明的，需要确认</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> Resolution<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n                    action<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"confirm\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                    message<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"您之前说'</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>old<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">'，现在'</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>new_memory<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">'，请确认？\"</span></span>\n                <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 默认：新信息覆盖旧信息，但保留旧版本</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> Resolution<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n            action<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"update\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            updates<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>old<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"archived\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> old <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> conflicting<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            insert<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>new_memory\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>时间衰减机制</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">MemoryDecayManager</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"记忆衰减管理器\"\"\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>decay_config <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"event_memory\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"half_life_days\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">7</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>    <span class=\"token comment\"># 事件记忆：7天半衰期</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"task_memory\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"half_life_days\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">30</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>     <span class=\"token comment\"># 任务记忆：30天</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"user_profile\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"half_life_days\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">365</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>   <span class=\"token comment\"># 用户画像：1年</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"core_fact\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"half_life_days\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">None</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>      <span class=\"token comment\"># 核心事实：不衰减</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">compute_score</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> memory<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> MemoryEntry<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">float</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"计算记忆当前的有效分数\"\"\"</span>\n        config <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>decay_config<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>memory<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>memory_type<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        half_life <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> config<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"half_life_days\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> half_life <span class=\"token keyword\">is</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">None</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 不衰减</span>\n            time_decay <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">1.0</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">else</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token comment\"># 艾宾浩斯衰减</span>\n            age_days <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>time<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>time<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span> memory<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>timestamp<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">/</span> <span class=\"token number\">86400</span>\n            time_decay <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.5</span> <span class=\"token operator\">**</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>age_days <span class=\"token operator\">/</span> half_life<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 访问频率提升</span>\n        freq_boost <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">1</span> <span class=\"token operator\">+</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.1</span> <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> memory<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>access_count\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 重要性权重</span>\n        importance <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> memory<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>importance\n        \n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> importance <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> time_decay <span class=\"token operator\">*</span> freq_boost\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">should_archive</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> memory<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> MemoryEntry<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">bool</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"判断是否应该归档\"\"\"</span>\n        score <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>compute_score<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>memory<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> score <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.1</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">cleanup</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> memories<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>MemoryEntry<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> List<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>MemoryEntry<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"清理低价值记忆\"\"\"</span>\n        retained <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> mem <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> memories<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">not</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>should_archive<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>mem<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                retained<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>mem<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">else</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>_archive<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>mem<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 归档而非删除</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> retained\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">_archive</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> memory<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> MemoryEntry<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"归档记忆\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 移动到归档存储（低成本长期存储）</span>\n        archive_storage<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>save<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>memory<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>多因子评分模型</strong>：</p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">score = α × importance + β × recency + γ × frequency + δ × relevance\n\n其中：\n- importance: 初始重要度（由 LLM 或规则打分）\n- recency: 时间衰减因子\n- frequency: 访问频次加成\n- relevance: 与当前查询的相关度\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h2 data-heading=\"2. 延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">2. 延伸追问</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问 1</strong>：用户说\"我之前说的不对\"怎么处理？答：找到之前相关记忆，标记为无效，更新为新信息。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问 2</strong>：衰减参数怎么调？答：根据业务场景设置半衰期，通过 A/B 测试找到最佳参数。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问 3</strong>：归档的记忆还能恢复吗？答：可以，归档是低成本存储，检索时可以扩展到归档层。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-heading=\"3. 常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">3. 常见误区</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区 1</strong>：冲突时直接覆盖旧记忆。应该保留历史版本，标记过期而非删除。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区 2</strong>：所有记忆用同一种衰减参数。不同类型记忆应该有不同衰减速度。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区 3</strong>：衰减就是定时删除。衰减应该是分数降低→归档→可能的清理，不是直接删除。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"4. 相关\" dir=\"auto\">4. 相关</h2>","headings":[]}